# source/ holds raw FBX authoring assets. Gitignored to avoid heavy
# (10s of MB) authoring artifacts in the repo. The bake regenerates
# humanoid.glb + skeleton.ozz + per-clip .ozz from these locally; the
# baked outputs ARE committed so CI / contributors without the source
# can build and run.
source/

# blender_authoring/ holds in-tree .blend files + intermediate exports
# from the authoring workflow. Author-side only -- not consumed by the
# build, not needed by CI.
blender_authoring/

# Authoring backups + workflow markers from iterations. Disk-only,
# never committed -- kept locally in case we ever want to A/B compare.
*.PRE_MBLAB_REDOWNLOAD
*.PRE_MBLAB_BACKUP
*.NOT_YET_REDOWNLOADED
*.NOT_A_CLIP
*.audit.json

# humanoid.glb and .ozz files ARE committed (small, ~few MB) so CI and
# contributors without the gitignored source can build and run. Locally
# the bake regenerates them from FBX when present. Negate the repo-root
# *.ozz rule for everything in this directory.
!*.ozz
!humanoid.glb
